d to the RCR to take exposure via ingestion into account.\n\nS\n\ntep 2: derivation generic PNEC sediment\n\nI\n\nf the outcome of the equilibrium partitioning method results in a PECsediment/PNECsediment ratio greater than 1, toxicity tests with sediment organisms are an essential requirement for a refined hazard assessment. See general guidance document on the information requirements for REACH.\n\nS", "metadata": {"doc_id": "0b73353d-817e-44cb-b45a-2f5cb5da9446", "content_type": "CompositeElement", "filename": "information_requirements_r7_13_2_en.pdf"}}